c3:I_D4_3_6_8 a c3:Indicator ;
  c3:hasCode "D4.3.6-8" ; rdfs:label "Present adaptations of arguments and explanations on topics of interest to others to reach audiences and venues outside the classroom using print and oral technologies (e.g., posters, essays, letters, debates, speeches, reports, and maps) and digital technologies (e.g., Internet, social media, and digital documentary)." ;
