c3:I_D4_6_6_8 a c3:Indicator ;
  c3:hasCode "D4.6.6-8" ; rdfs:label "Draw on multiple disciplinary lenses to analyze how a specific problem can manifest itself at local, regional, and global levels over time, identifying its characteristics and causes, and the challenges and opportunities faced by those trying to address the problem." ;
